---
import { cloudDmaOption, homeFaqs, homeSeo, productInfo, siteConfig } from '../data/site';
import { relatedSearchTerms } from '../data/seo/keywords';

const shareUrl = encodeURIComponent(siteConfig.url + '/');
const shareText = encodeURIComponent('The Isle Cheats - ESP and hacks for The Isle players');
---

<section class="home-seo shell" aria-labelledby="home-seo-title">
	<div class="home-seo__panel card-surface">
		<h2 id="home-seo-title">{homeSeo.whyUsHeading}</h2>
		<p>{homeSeo.whyUsIntro}</p>
		<ul class="home-seo__bullets">
			{homeSeo.whyUsPoints.map((point) => (
				<li>{point}</li>
			))}
		</ul>

		<div class="home-seo__grid">
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/the-isle-esp/">ESP overlay guide</a></h3>
				<p>
					Visuals ESP and World ESP cover entities, health, growth, resources, bodies, meat, fruits, herbs,
					mushrooms, and water with configurable range and colors.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/the-isle-cheats/">Product hub</a></h3>
				<p>
					Cloud-DMA packages, hack options, and buying guides for Windows PC players.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/cheats/">Combat hack options</a></h3>
				<p>
					Instant Rotation, Auto-Attack, Omnimovement, No Cooldown Attack, Unlock Zoom, and other movement
					and combat tools included in Cloud-DMA.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/the-isle-features/">Full feature list</a></h3>
				<p>
					Cloud-DMA, Visuals ESP, World ESP, combat hacks, utility tools, and optional Aimbot details in
					one place.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/the-isle-guide/">Survival & growth guides</a></h3>
				<p>
					Tactics, growth paths, performance tips, and package selection for new and veteran players.
				</p>
			</article>
			<article>
				<h3><a href="/pricing/">Pricing & licenses</a></h3>
				<p>
					Compare monthly and lifetime plans. Cloud-DMA includes ESP, World ESP, combat hacks, and utility
					tools.
				</p>
			</article>
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="home-seo__panel card-surface">
		<h2>What's in the package</h2>
		<p>
			A Windows PC software license with Visuals ESP, World ESP, combat hacks, and utility tools. The
			{cloudDmaOption.label} option includes ESP, World ESP, combat hacks, and Other features without
			Aimbot. Packages also support configs, English and Russian languages, and in-client toggles.
		</p>
		<ul>
			{productInfo.features.visualsEsp.slice(0, 6).map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
			{productInfo.features.cheats.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
			{productInfo.features.general.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
		</ul>
		<p>
			Package pricing is listed on the
			<a href="/pricing/">pricing page</a>
			so you can compare duration against budget. Maintenance notes appear on
			<a href="/updates/">product update notices</a>
			whenever a build or compatibility change is published.
		</p>
	</div>

	<section class="home-seo__panel card-surface" id="undetected" data-nav-section="undetected">
		<h2>How to evaluate ESP and Cloud-DMA</h2>
		<p>
			Start with the survival information you care about most. If threat awareness and map reading are your
			priority, open the ESP page and confirm which Visuals ESP and World ESP categories match your play
			style. If movement and combat hacks matter more, review Cheats for Instant Rotation, Auto-Attack,
			and Omnimovement. Many players check both pages, then use the feature list as a final checklist
			before choosing a monthly or lifetime license.
		</p>
		<p>
			Delivery is digital after payment confirmation. Timing can vary by payment method and order review.
			After purchase, watch the Updates page for maintenance notes tied to The Isle patches, and contact
			support if license delivery or setup needs clarification. Platforms supported today:
			{productInfo.platforms.join(', ')}. Market availability: {siteConfig.market}.
		</p>
		<p>
			This site is designed for clear product research rather than vague claims. Each internal page has a
			focused job: ESP explains visibility hacks, Cheats explains movement and combat options, Features
			summarizes the full package, Pricing compares plan lengths, FAQ answers common purchase questions,
			and Support is the contact path when something needs a human reply.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="home-seo__faq" id="blog" data-nav-section="blog" aria-labelledby="home-faq-title">
		<h2 id="home-faq-title">Common questions</h2>
		<div class="home-seo__faq-list">
			{
				homeFaqs.map((item) => (
					<details class="home-seo__item">
						<summary>{item.question}</summary>
						<p>{item.answer}</p>
					</details>
				))
			}
		</div>
		<p class="home-seo__more">
			More answers are on the <a href="/the-isle-faq/">The Isle FAQ</a> and <a href="/faq/">full FAQ hub</a>.
			Explore <a href="/the-isle-survival-guide/">The Isle Survival Guide</a>,
			<a href="/the-isle-growth-guide/">Growth Guide</a>, and
			<a href="/blog/">The Isle Blog</a>. Policy details are in
			<a href="/refund-policy/">our refund policy</a>,
			<a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>, and
			<a href="/terms/">terms of use</a>.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="home-seo__share" aria-labelledby="share-title">
		<h2 id="share-title">Share The Isle Cheats</h2>
		<p>Pass this page along if someone else is comparing ESP and hack options for The Isle.</p>
		<div class="home-seo__share-row">
			<a
				class="share-link"
				href={`https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=${shareUrl}&text=${shareText}`}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>
				Share on X
			</a>
			<a
				class="share-link"
				href={`https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=${shareUrl}`}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>
				Share on Facebook
			</a>
			<a
				class="share-link"
				href={`https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=${shareUrl}&title=${shareText}`}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>
				Share on Reddit
			</a>
			<a
				class="share-link"
				href={`https://www.linkedin.com/sharing/share-offsite/?url=${shareUrl}`}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
			>
				Share on LinkedIn
			</a>
		</div>
	</section>

	<nav class="home-seo__searches" aria-label="Related searches for The Isle Cheats">
		<p class="home-seo__searches-label">Related searches</p>
		<ul class="home-seo__searches-list">
			{
				relatedSearchTerms.map((term) => (
					<li>
						<a href={term.href}>{term.label}</a>
					</li>
				))
			}
		</ul>
	</nav>
</section>

<style>
	.home-seo {
		display: grid;
		gap: 1.5rem;
		padding-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.card-surface {
		padding: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 1.75rem);
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.16);
		background: rgba(26, 22, 38, 0.72);
	}

	.home-seo h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
		font-weight: 800;
	}

	.home-seo p {
		margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		line-height: 1.65;
	}

	.home-seo ul,
	.home-seo__bullets {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.45rem;
	}

	.home-seo li,
	.home-seo__bullets li {
		position: relative;
		padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem 0.55rem 1.85rem;
		border-radius: 0.65rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1);
		background: rgba(10, 6, 18, 0.35);
		color: #d4cae6;
		font-size: 0.94rem;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.home-seo li::before,
	.home-seo__bullets li::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0.75rem;
		top: 50%;
		width: 0.35rem;
		height: 0.35rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: var(--color-orchid);
		transform: translateY(-50%);
	}

	.home-seo a {
		color: var(--color-orchid);
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.home-seo a:hover {
		color: var(--color-ink);
	}

	.home-seo__grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 0.85rem;
		margin-top: 1.35rem;
	}

	.home-seo__grid article {
		padding: 1rem;
		border-radius: 0.9rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.14);
		background: rgba(10, 6, 18, 0.35);
	}

	.home-seo__grid h3 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 750;
	}

	.home-seo__grid p {
		margin-top: 0.45rem;
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}

	.home-seo__faq-list {
		display: grid;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.home-seo__item {
		border-radius: 0.85rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.14);
		background: rgba(26, 22, 38, 0.65);
		padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
	}

	.home-seo__item summary {
		cursor: pointer;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--color-ink);
	}

	.home-seo__item p {
		margin-top: 0.65rem;
	}

	.home-seo__more {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
	}

	.home-seo__share {
		padding: clamp(1.1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
		border-radius: var(--radius-card);
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.14);
		background: rgba(18, 16, 26, 0.55);
	}

	.home-seo__share-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	.share-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		min-height: 2.5rem;
		padding: 0.55rem 0.95rem;
		border-radius: 0.7rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.25);
		background: rgba(34, 28, 48, 0.85);
		color: var(--color-ink) !important;
		font-size: 0.88rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		transition:
			border-color 0.2s ease,
			background 0.2s ease;
	}

	.share-link:hover {
		border-color: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.5);
		background: rgba(48, 36, 72, 0.9);
	}

	.home-seo__searches {
		padding: 0.85rem 0 0.25rem;
		border-top: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08);
	}

	.home-seo__searches-label {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.55);
	}

	.home-seo__searches-list {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.35rem 0.5rem;
		margin: 0.55rem 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.home-seo__searches-list a {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.08);
		background: rgba(10, 6, 18, 0.25);
		color: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.72);
		font-size: 0.72rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		line-height: 1.35;
	}

	.home-seo__searches-list a:hover {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
	}

	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.home-seo__grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
